          "files_unchanged": true,
          "backup_expected": false,
          "no_network_to": [
            "api.superdocs.app.evil.example"
          ]
        }
      },
      "_why": "Host matching must compare the full host EXACTLY. A suffix or substring check would read this as canonical and send a live key to an attacker."
    },
    {
      "name": "host-rule-userinfo-not-printed",
